{"title":"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems/Relay 2 Problem A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A line passing through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbe73df99f077b1d0d28bd61e930cde0a33d4af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5, k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"57\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73f88d156779ae240828966a6a25675035486bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(13, -7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"65\" height=\"20\" /> has a slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a7748d3d38355a68b51bddc29d7647230728287e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Relay_2_Problem_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Slope\" title=\"Slope\">slope</a> of a line can be calculated by finding the change in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> divided by the change in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Using this, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/6/a16ce2736d16ec907b167dab826e76a8be8e0642.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-7 - k}{13 - (-5)} = \\frac{-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"135\" height=\"44\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/1/9617f43f9cca4b6adaa7ee589edb546b4394b0fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-7 - k}{18} = \\frac{-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97ad8ee8865c4f8fc4efe2370a2fb4cfd330f46d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-7 - k = \\frac{-1}{2} \\times 18 = -9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"197\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/f/e2f0d571a454f4a34fefe541b3924a9d2cbd79b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = -7 + 9 = \\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"135\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC\">2021 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"